Patch 0007 (dependency-trimming) of fid-clarabel, spec node KRN.SOLV.CONIC.PATCH.

Remove every third-party dependency: derive_builder (hand-written Default), enum_dispatch (hand-written match dispatch), itertools (std zip), lazy_static (the infinity bound becomes a constant) and thiserror (hand-written Display and Error).

Rule IDs and rationale: vendor/fid-clarabel/AUDIT.toml.

